WEBVTT

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:03.490
<i>The Kaidou Haru I know</i>

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:06.690
<i>is the most successful 
and popular host, Natsu.</i>

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:10.700
<i>He was nice to everyone else, but cold to me.</i>

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.670
<i>No one could ever tie down Natsu,</i>

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:17.120
<i>who was like an untouchable 
and valuable jewel.</i>

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.800
Good morning!

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.250
Haru-san, what's for lunch toda—

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.450
Uh, the mood in here is making me 
really not want to step inside...

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.340
I want to leave.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.160
Is something wrong?

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:37.090
Iku, I think I'm done for.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:46.690
Let's conduct a physical exam together

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:41.440
Did Ren Ren find that porn DVD of yours?

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.530
No, I have Ren's permission to keep this.

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:46.880
That Ren Ren really does 
act like a man sometimes.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:51.230
Uniform Girl

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.320
Did you not like it?

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:53.840
No, not at all. In fact, 
I'd rank it in my top three.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:54.890
What's wrong, then?

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:55.740
I can't get it up.

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:57.550
What?

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:00.900
I can't get it up even 
though it's my top three!

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.370
That can't be good!

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:05.620
R-Right... Wait, what is this?

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:09.940
I can't see clearly because 
of the tears in my eyes...

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:11.130
<i>Several years later,</i>

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:16.130
<i>I'm reminded every day that the man 
I looked up to is nowhere to be found now.</i>

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.020
Ren.

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:50.550
Morning.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:52.520
Juuzen, you don't look well.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.210
Did you not get enough sleep?

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.880
Exams start next week.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:00.780
My roommate won't shut up about studying.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:05.140
As long as I stay in the dorms, 
I'll be super stressed out.

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:06.290
Come to think of it,

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:09.290
how are you taking care of yourself, Juuzen?

00:03:09.490 --> 00:03:11.990
Huh? Taking care of what?

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:13.240
Remember what the school doctor said?

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:16.050
If you don't release what's 
built up, it's not good for—

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:17.550
Ren!

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.500
C'mon, let's go to the health care room!

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:24.970
Cheer up.

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:27.420
Or do you need to go see some girls?

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:28.860
I can't.

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:31.020
I don't think I can get it up 
for anyone but Ren right now.

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:35.470
<i>What did he just casually say?!</i>

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:42.280
Apathetic

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:40.790
Sorry... I can't help you with that.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.190
Hup...

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:47.030
And your mom's staying with you right now, too.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:49.690
It's like living with the devil.

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:54.400
I hope she'll stay to keep 
Ren Ren out of harm's way.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.290
I'm in bigger trouble than he is.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.420
Yesterday, just when things 
were getting good...

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.180
Haruko's home!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.950
I've been wondering for a while,

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:07.610
but what kind of relationship 
do you want with Ren Ren?

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:12.970
You boys again?

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:14.980
It's too early to be making so much noise.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.350
I can't do it!

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:19.130
Doctor, you've gotta teach him sex education!

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:19.980
What?

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:23.310
I told you before.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:25.560
If you feel horny, go jerk off.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:27.490
You're not too specific, are you?!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.480
I'm not having any trouble doing it.

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:33.660
Then what's the problem?

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:39.130
All I did was ask Juuzen how he does it.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:41.530
This isn't you!

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:42.710
You're biased.

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:46.380
You don't look like someone who 
would blush over that, either.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:48.100
At least listen to what he has to say.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.760
Please just stay our sweet little fairy!

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:52.580
Everyone in our class agreed

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.080
not to make dirty jokes around you!

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:59.020
Your class really loves you, huh?

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:03.590
Anyway, don't you have three older brothers?

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.030
I'm sure you can imagine how they do it.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.660
I have no idea.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:12.680
Even though I sleep in the same bed 
as Haru, I have no idea what he does.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.660
But it's not fair for me to be on the 
receiving end all the time, right?

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:24.800
Kaidou, don't ever mention 
that to anyone again.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.880
See? See? I told you!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.320
Then who should I talk to?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.660
Your dirty older brother, of course!

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:40.100
Ren, what are you doing?

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:44.440
The other day, we didn't get to do 
anything since Haruko interrupted us.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:46.450
I want to do it for you, too.

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:50.380
I appreciate it, but I'm tired.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:54.090
Don't you want to do it?

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:56.710
<i>Haruko-san,</i>

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.190
<i>I'm sorry for calling you the devil.</i>

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:01.550
<i>This guy's the actual devil.</i>

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:05.610
<i>He's so cute, dirty, and 
hits all my weak points.</i>

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:09.970
<i>I know it's wrong because I'm the adult,</i>

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:13.100
<i>but I can't say no.</i>

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:18.190
It's already late, so this is all for today, Ren.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:22.860
Haru-san,

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.390
what kind of relationship 
do you want with Ren Ren?

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:29.350
Huh? I've never thought about it.

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:32.160
Yikes! You really are a 
terrible adult, aren't you?

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:35.840
<i>Thinking about it wouldn't do any good.</i>

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:39.000
<i>He's just so precious. 
He's too important to me.</i>

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:42.660
<i>I'd gladly do the impossible for him,</i>

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:47.750
<i>not that he'd ever ask me to.</i>

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:54.990
Aki.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.090
Hey.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:00.080
If you're here, I should 
tell Haru about dinner.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.110
Haruko said she'd be home early, too.

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.700
Oh... I don't need dinner.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:07.030
I just came to get something.

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:08.400
Ren, welcome home.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:13.030
Shima, did you make an appointment 
for Bro's checkup and counseling?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:16.260
Yeah, but he skipped last 
year's appointment, too.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:18.910
Is something wrong with Haru?

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:20.050
Oh, uh...

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:23.410
It's okay. There's nothing wrong with him.

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:26.170
But since the accident was so serious,

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.670
he just goes for a checkup once 
a year, to be on the safe side.

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.210
Sorry.

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:34.650
I haven't had the opportunity 
to ask Haru about the accident.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.330
That's fine.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.680
He shouldn't have to think 
about it most of the time.

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:40.930
Could you say something to him, too?

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:43.620
He'll probably go if you tell him to.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:44.630
Got it.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.530
Haruko, welcome home.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:52.260
Hey.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:55.850
Is that Aki?

00:07:56.310 --> 00:08:00.340
So Shima looks like your dad, 
and Aki looks like your mom.

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:02.460
Your face is shaped just like Ruri's.

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:06.640
I'm leaving.

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:11.020
Ren, tell Bro to go to his checkup.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:14.230
Haru's checkup?

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:17.070
I could go with him.

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:18.350
Why would you do that?

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:20.250
He's not a child.

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:23.100
Besides, it's been so long since 
the accident. You're overreacting.

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:28.980
You...

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:33.320
You're only able to say that 
because you didn't see him then.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.110
Aki...

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:37.370
You don't know what shape he was in!

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:41.790
Do you know how he looked when 
they took him to the hospital?!

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:43.830
His body was covered in blood,

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.490
and his brain was swollen from the crash!

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:48.990
Even after he woke up one month later,

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:53.280
he didn't recognize us or even 
know who he was for a while!

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.680
On top of that, he'd go crazy 
because he couldn't sleep!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.760
He kept hurting himself!

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:04.180
Aki.

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:05.550
Shut up!

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:08.690
She doesn't know what 
happened to him after that!

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:12.120
He dropped out of high 
school and disappeared.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:16.450
He only remembered who Ren was 
because Ren came to see him!

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:19.510
Why did you abandon him, anyway?

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:21.900
Don't tell me you didn't 
know about the accident.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:24.710
That lawyer woman should've told you!

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:25.640
So why?!

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:29.530
Ren.

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:31.300
Stop blaming Haruko.

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:34.300
It's not her fault. Haruko's not in the wrong.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.110
Ren, you bastard!

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:35.590
Aki!

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:38.340
Haruko couldn't go to Japan because of me.

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:39.780
What?

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:40.600
Huh?

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:44.100
Is everyone here? Good.

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:47.050
Mikiko-san just got here, so tonight...

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.070
Huh? Did I come at a bad time?

00:09:58.600 --> 00:09:59.240
Ren?

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:02.190
It's not a big deal.

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:03.820
I'm going to talk to Ren.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.560
Lousy timing...

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:08.340
Aki?

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:17.480
I don't think Haruko-san 
could've come to Japan then.

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:20.110
Her son was in a life-or-death situation.

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:22.550
She could've brought Ren with her.

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:24.890
I'm saying she couldn't do that.

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:26.850
Why not?

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.230
When Ren was first getting used to me,

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:33.140
I took him to the supermarket once.

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:34.980
But...

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:39.710
Just going into a crowded place 
for a moment made him shake.

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:41.120
He started panicking.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.620
BAAARF!

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:47.620
After that,

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:52.630
he avoided me and the car for a few days.

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:55.530
She couldn't take someone like that

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:57.530
on an airplane, much less to Japan.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:01.140
That's still not a reason to abandon you.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:03.760
It's not as though she abandoned him.

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.510
Mikiko-san?

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:10.390
You think I'm just some middle-aged 
lady she knows, don't you?

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:14.170
I'm the one who took the accident's case

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:16.900
and procured your parents' burial grounds.

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:20.570
I'm the one who found your brother 
when he went missing, too.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:23.820
I've also acted as his guarantor 
in a variety of situations.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:28.720
There's no way I would do all 
that just to be considerate.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.420
I'm just doing the jobs I've been hired to do.

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:35.080
And you know who did that, right?

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:39.170
If you're going to hide in there all night,

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.740
I won't have anywhere to sleep.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:50.450
In that regard, you haven't matured at all.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:56.030
There's no point in worrying 
about Haru anymore, is there?

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:57.750
It's over and done with.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:00.440
There's no reason for 
you to feel responsible.

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:05.720
But if I hadn't been there, you wouldn't 
have invited Haru to Canada, right?

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:09.740
And you would've been able to go 
see him if anything had happened.

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:10.700
I wouldn't.

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:14.400
I'd never go to see Haru.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:18.640
I told Haru the same thing when 
he left Canada for Japan as a child.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:23.110
Why did you let Haru go?

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:28.220
Well... because I couldn't stop being me.

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:32.910
I prioritized being myself 
over being a mother.

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:34.230
That's all.

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:37.000
You weren't lonely?

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.480
I had you.

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:41.230
My hands were full enough with that.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.930
Even now, I came all the way 
here from Europe for you.

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:47.600
Even though I hate Japanese summers.

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:48.490
Sorry.

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:52.580
But I'm glad I got to see you again.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:53.640
I know.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.280
I'm glad to see you, too.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:00.360
I just regret letting you two 
go a little bit right now.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:05.420
I never even considered how 
quickly children grow up.

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:10.390
Anyway, I haven't given up on taking 
you back to Switzerland with me.

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:11.140
Flinch!!

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:14.440
Haruko-san? Ren?

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:15.800
Dinner's ready.

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:18.190
<i>Despite what Haruko says...</i>

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:20.900
What the... Ren, are you 
pretending to be a basket worm?

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:24.520
<i>As far as Haru's concerned, 
Haruko hasn't changed a bit.</i>

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:23.000
Let go!

00:13:24.020 --> 00:13:25.130
Let's eat.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.470
<i>While Haruko's not around,</i>

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:31.620
<i>sometimes Haru calls Haruko "Mom."</i>

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:34.610
What? Really?

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.620
I had no idea.

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:38.760
That's pretty juicy!

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:50.630
<i>I know Haru calls her that totally naturally.</i>

00:13:57.890 --> 00:13:58.980
Mom?

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:01.670
Don't make Ren sleep out here.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:04.890
You two really haven't 
made any progress at all.

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:09.470
Actually, Ren said he'd wait up for you.

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:12.490
I was just drinking with Mikiko in your bar.

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:17.210
He was worried about what Aki said to you.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:20.000
He was probably worried that 
you wouldn't come back.

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:23.490
Even though there are people around,

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:26.010
Ren's fast asleep.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:29.490
Well, it's way past his bedtime.

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:31.510
The Ren I know

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:35.680
would never sleep in the presence of others.

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:38.550
But he sleeps so easily by your side.

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:39.270
Huh?

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:44.110
That's why I said you two haven't changed.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:45.810
You haven't made any progress.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:49.840
Besides, who could sleep so soundly 
in front of the one they love?

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:54.380
Either Ren's bold or you're 
totally incompetent.

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:57.360
It's a funny arrangement.

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:59.120
It's none of your business.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:02.710
<i>I still remember it clearly...</i>

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:03.760
What?

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:07.530
<i>The face of that little kid glaring 
at me in the middle of the night.</i>

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:12.540
<i>He was so on edge, there 
was nothing cute about him.</i>

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:14.810
<i>But now...</i>

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:19.300
<i>Haruko-san says he hasn't changed,</i>

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:21.320
<i>but he wasn't always like this.</i>

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:28.910
<i>But maybe I'm the one who hasn't changed.</i>

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.950
Final Exam Room 
For Kaidou Ren 
Authorized Personnel Only 
(Go to the faculty office if you're sick)

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:37.700
There's still time before the exam starts.

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:39.550
Can I ask you a question?

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:41.960
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:45.460
If this is about the other day, 
that's outside my area of expertise.

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.460
I don't know anything about 
sex between two dudes.

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:50.500
Two men? Is that even possible?

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:51.330
How?

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.970
How does it work?

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:58.970
Damn it! If you don't stop talking, 
I'll dock your score, Kaidou!

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:02.630
Fine. I'll ask you after the exam.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.560
I made a huge mistake.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:06.650
You'd better not run.

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:10.200
As the school doctor, you have a 
responsibility to answer my questions.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:13.490
You're evil.

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:16.490
Hey, Haru, look at this!

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:20.670
It's your birthday today, right?

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:22.000
It's a present for you.

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:23.920
I'm not wearing that.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:27.000
How would you ever fit in a small?

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:29.890
Is the joke that you'll wear it?

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:33.600
Honestly, I don't want to see a 
24-year-old man in a sailor uniform.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:36.260
If you don't shut up, I'll kill you.

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:41.020
I made this in your youngest brother's size.

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:46.040
<i>What do you enjoy about 
dressing me up like this?</i>

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:48.840
<i>Y-You pervert! Don't...</i>

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:53.780
Taboo

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:57.790
<i>Crap! I almost developed a new fetish there!</i>

00:16:57.790 --> 00:17:00.160
If you don't want it, that's fine.

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.440
Sorry. Please let me have it.

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:04.140
That's a good boy.

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.130
This is sort of déjà vu.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:11.130
"Kiyoka's choice wasn't wrong."

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:15.880
You like mild curry?

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:16.640
Mild Curry

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.510
If you don't like it, don't eat it.

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:21.350
Our brother likes your curry, right?

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.570
If that's the case, 
then make it how you want.

00:17:23.570 --> 00:17:25.800
It's not like I care.

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:26.900
What's going on?

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:29.160
It's awfully noisy in here.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:31.400
It's going to be a while longer.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:34.180
Could you go entertain our brother?

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:35.700
Fine.

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:37.660
Huh?

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:38.930
Haruko-san?

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:43.270
I never thought the bumbling Ren 
would ever stand in a kitchen.

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:46.920
Once I taught him how to cook, 
he really got into it.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:51.920
Ren's starting to learn things
I didn't teach him.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:55.380
He's always been smart,

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.070
and he's a hard worker.

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:59.280
It's impressive.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:03.710
But he doesn't really seem 
to like everything he does.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:05.680
I know.

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:11.350
I only made Ren do the things
I wanted him to do.

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:16.970
Yeah, but he still happily 
hand-picks coffee beans.

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:18.630
He can roast them by hand, too.

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:21.700
His Italian roast is exactly to your tastes.

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:23.950
You taught him that, didn't you?

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:27.370
I think Ren enjoyed those kinds of things.

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.210
More than the material itself,

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:34.460
he liked learning from you.

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:39.720
He seemed to like dog sled 
racing, too, unlike me.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:43.770
Even though you grew up in Canada, 
you can't stand the cold.

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:45.220
Is that right?

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:47.480
Haru-san, the cake's here!

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.830
Can I join today's curry party?

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:52.540
It's not a curry party!

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:54.980
It's my 24th birthday party!

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:58.600
What? But isn't today's 
main dish Ren Ren's curry?

00:18:58.600 --> 00:18:59.940
Yes, but...

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:07.250
Ren Ren!

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:09.690
What should we do about the candles?

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:11.500
Should we use 24 of 'em?

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:15.080
No, you'll ruin the cake.

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:17.760
You're not going to ask for my opinion?

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:20.510
Oh, right. Ren, did you write down your wish?

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:22.070
My wish?

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:24.010
It's July 7th.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:27.970
Ren, do you know the legend of Tanabata?

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:28.710
Oh, right...

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:34.470
God got mad at Orihime and Hikoboshi because 
they flirted too much instead of working,

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:37.310
so he made it so they could only 
see each other once a year, right?

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:39.130
Haruko-san, Haruko-san!

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:40.650
What did you teach him as a child?!

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:44.960
If you two go too far, 
I'll be taking Ren with me.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:47.660
God

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.660
Don't say things like that on my birthday!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:49.530
It's okay.

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:52.600
No matter what happens, I won't leave you.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:53.670
Ren!

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:57.130
You can hang mine for me.

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:57.880
Huh?!

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:00.510
I want to try rice pudding.
-Ren

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.950
Okay, got it.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:06.060
I can't...

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:06.990
Don't laugh!

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:09.180
<i>It doesn't matter how small it is.</i>

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:11.310
I hope Ren gets taller.
-Haru

00:20:10.070 --> 00:20:14.780
<i>Being able to do something for 
someone else can make you happy.</i>

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:12.940
I want to try rice pudding.
-Ren

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:14.360
I want marbled beef.
-Aki

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.520
I hope our brother stops 
running out of control.
-Shima

00:20:17.260 --> 00:20:18.570
You're going back to Switzerland?

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:23.120
If I don't get back soon, it'll have 
negative affects on my research.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:26.580
But my exams aren't over.

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:29.930
No matter how they turn out, you're still 
not coming to Switzerland, right?

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:30.800
No.

00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:32.510
Then there's no point in asking.

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:35.810
Come to think of it, you're taking your 
exams in the health care room, right?

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:37.170
How's that working?

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.830
It's not a problem.

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:42.050
And since the proctor is the doctor, 
I got to ask some useful questions.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:42.970
Questions?

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:45.600
About sex between two men.

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:47.100
Huh?

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:50.600
There's still a lot I don't understand,

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:54.600
but I did learn that it's important to 
start by getting more experience.

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:58.990
I'll be in the health care room again today. 
I'm thinking of asking him for more details.

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:01.220
You...

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:02.110
idiot!

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:04.290
You should stay home from school for a while!

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:07.830
But if I don't take my exams, 
they'll make me pay for tuition.

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:11.550
I'm sure they will! But it's 
your fault for being an idiot!

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:16.130
<i>In some ways, it's become clear that 
our youngest brother is an idiot.</i>

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:20.160
Well, if his brother's an idiot, 
he's bound to be similar.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:21.960
Are you in any position to talk?!

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:24.150
It takes one to know one!

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:25.130
What did you say?

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.620
You're going to be punished!

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:28.350
Why do I have to be punished?

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:33.890
Screech            Screech

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:30.750
Haruko-san, do you need me 
to take you to the airport?

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:32.070
I'll go with you.

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:33.890
Thanks, I could use the help.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:36.240
<i>I knew they were no good.</i>

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:39.110
<i>My eldest and youngest are totally useless.</i>

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:44.900
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire.</i>

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:49.950
Why did you dress me like this, you pervert?

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:52.950
How are you so fiendishly cute?

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:55.650
Don't be ridiculous, you rotten brother!

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:59.320
<i>It's also clear that our 
oldest brother is an idiot.</i>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:40.220
Next Time
